action "Audit AUR packages"
exec  pacman -Qqm --color never
log   audit AUDIT: AUR audit: 2 checked, 2 flagged
audit 2 foreign package(s) checked against the AUR
audit
audit ✖ 2 look closely  ⚠ 0 glance  ✔ 0 clean
audit
audit ✖ yay-bin  maintainer changed: jguer → mallory
audit ✖ foo-git  adopted by eve (was orphaned)
audit
audit Flagged maintainers stay flagged on every audit until you've checked them and press a to accept.
audit Recent = pushed within 72h, the same window as an AUR cooldown hook.
end   outcome=report errs=0 skipped=0
